<title>POLAND: UNIVERSAL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.78 vs   2.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.45 vs   2.41</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.95 vs   0.22 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    9.90 vs  12.96</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    15.41 vs   7.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	19.86 vs   7.39</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.91 vs   2.61 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   87.32 vs  83.76</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading firm is Universal SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
